    "controls": {
      "en": "Match the next parcel label. Tap a route and Send. Keys 1/2/3 select; Space sends; A auto; P pause; R reset. Portrait controls scroll vertically.",
      "zh": "匹配下一件包裹标签，轻触线路再发送。1/2/3 选线，空格发送，A 自动，P 暂停，R 重置；竖屏操作区可上下滚动。"
    },
    "notes": {
      "en": "The original game is silent. Exit/reload starts a fresh shift. Web game labels and browser controls support English and Simplified Chinese; the original downloadable native package is unchanged. Export records and exact-head browser acceptance are separate; an export alone is not playability proof. No physical-device, Safari/Firefox or deployment claim.",
      "zh": "原作无音轨；退出或刷新即开始新班次，Web画面与浏览器控件支持中英文，原始原生下载包保持不变。导出记录与当前版本真实浏览器验收分开，导出成功不等于玩法通过；未声称实体设备、Safari、Firefox 或上线验证。"
    }
  },
  "reuse_existing_runtime": "play/runtime/godot-4.6.3.*",
  "requires_real_browser_and_visual_review": true
